 line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213475,"global_rank":254712,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40472},{"name":"KhwajaK/Authors-and-Books","owner":"KhwajaK","html_url":"https://github.com/KhwajaK/Authors-and-Books","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Authors and their favorite books -- assignment for Coding Dojo","topics":[],"score":213474,"global_rank":254732,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40473},{"name":"Talophex/ProjectEuler","owner":"Talophex","html_url":"https://github.com/Talophex/ProjectEuler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Code used to solve problems on https://projecteuler.net/","topics":["discrete-mathematics","mathematics","number-theory","python"],"score":213470,"global_rank":254746,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40474},{"name":"anjaldoshi/allen","owner":"anjaldoshi","html_url":"https://github.com/anjaldoshi/allen","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213470,"global_rank":254748,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40475},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest",